{
  "uid": "red-use",
  "title": "RED y USE · sitios y Pods",
  "tags": [
    "cloudops",
    "red",
    "use",
    "spec-019"
  ],
  "timezone": "America/Bogota",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "editable": false,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cómo leer este tablero",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**RED** (lo que vive el cliente): *Rate* peticiones por segundo, *Errors* proporción de respuestas 5xx y *Duration* percentil 95 del tiempo de respuesta, por sitio, según Traefik. **USE** (lo que sufre el Pod): *Utilization* uso frente al límite de CPU y de memoria, *Saturation* CPU frenada por el límite (throttling) y *Errors* reinicios por falta de memoria (OOM). El límite es el de la cuota del plan del cliente; cerca del 100 % el Pod se frena o se reinicia. Qué hacer: runbooks `saturacion.md` y `latencia.md`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "RED · por sitio",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Rate · peticiones por segundo",
      "description": "Peticiones que Traefik entrega a cada sitio.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(traefik_service_requests_total{service=~\"cliente-.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errors · proporción de 5xx",
      "description": "Fracción de respuestas 5xx sobre el total de cada sitio; 0 si no hay tráfico.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(traefik_service_requests_total{service=~\"cliente-.*\",code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum by (service) (rate(traefik_service_requests_total{service=~\"cliente-.*\"}[5m])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Duration · percentil 95 (s)",
      "description": "El 95 % de las peticiones responde en menos de este tiempo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, service) (rate(traefik_service_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=~\"cliente-.*\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Duration · sondeo de salud (s)",
      "description": "Tiempo del sondeo del /health (Blackbox, cada 5 s); sirve aunque no haya tráfico.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "probe_duration_seconds{job=\"sitios\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{client}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "USE · por Pod",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Utilization · CPU frente al límite",
      "description": "CPU usada dividida por el límite del contenedor; 1 = al límite.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (namespace, pod) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=~\"cliente-.*|hub\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"}[5m])) / sum by (namespace, pod) (container_spec_cpu_quota{namespace=~\"cliente-.*|hub\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"} / container_spec_cpu_period{namespace=~\"cliente-.*|hub\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}/{{pod}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Utilization · memoria frente al límite",
      "description": "Memoria en uso (working set) dividida por el límite del contenedor; cerca de 1 = riesgo de OOM.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (namespace, pod) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=~\"cliente-.*|hub\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"}) / (sum by (namespace, pod) (container_spec_memory_limit_bytes{namespace=~\"cliente-.*|hub\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"}) > 0)",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}/{{pod}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Saturation · CPU frenada por el límite",
      "description": "Fracción de periodos en que el contenedor quiso más CPU de la permitida y se frenó.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (namespace, pod) (rate(container_cpu_cfs_throttled_periods_total{namespace=~\"cliente-.*|hub\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum by (namespace, pod) (rate(container_cpu_cfs_periods_total{namespace=~\"cliente-.*|hub\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"}[5m])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}/{{pod}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errors · reinicios por falta de memoria (OOM)",
      "description": "Veces que el kernel mató el contenedor por pasarse de su límite de memoria en la última hora.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 29,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (namespace, pod) (increase(container_oom_events_total{namespace=~\"cliente-.*|hub\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}/{{pod}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
